// PENDING: from an OPEN SigmaHQ pull request. Not reviewed or merged by SigmaHQ yet.
// Pull request: #6540 Sigma: PavinLoader fake-driver MSI campaign (MSBuild from %LOCALAPPDATA%, MSBUILDENABLEALLPROPERTYFUNCTIONS, fake dllhost/taskhostw tasks, m
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/6540
// Pull request author: fotedev
// Change: new rule
// Title: MSBuild.exe Execution from User-Writable Directory via cmd.exe
// Sigma ID: a5280adc-4014-4201-bd72-ec3a3085aa64
// Status: experimental | Level: medium
// Author: fotedev
// Date: 2026-10-29 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, defense-impairment, T1127.001
// Description: Detects MSBuild.exe running from a user-writable directory (for example %LOCALAPPDATA% or
//   %TEMP%) with cmd.exe as the parent process. Observed in the PavinLoader incident: a fake .NET
//   solution ("CatalogIngestor" / "Ingestion Labs") ships a bundled MSBuild.exe (255,904 bytes,
//   4.8.9032.0, Authenticode HashMismatch) that build.cmd invokes from %LOCALAPPDATA% after setting
//   MSBUILDENABLEALLPROPERTYFUNCTIONS=1. In-memory assembly loading follows via Internal.targets
//   property functions.
// False positives:
//   - Developer workstations or CI agents that intentionally run portable MSBuild copies from user-writable directories
// References:
//   - https://github.com/fotedev/pavinloader-easeus-campaign
//   - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1127/001/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/6ead36c4ad43fd558f6614e9debb235df9de2d40/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_msbuild_user_writable_path_cmd_parent.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\cmd.exe" and FolderPath endswith "\\MSBuild.exe" and (FolderPath contains "\\AppData\\Local\\" or FolderPath contains "\\AppData\\Roaming\\" or FolderPath contains "\\Users\\Public\\" or FolderPath contains "\\Windows\\Temp\\")
